WEBVTT

00:00:05.320 --> 00:00:13.730
Since she first began living with Jone the honey man, Erin has been trekking up the mountain every summer.

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:20.170
She's constantly in search of beast-lords.

00:00:44.030 --> 00:00:45.370
You can do it.

00:01:10.990 --> 00:01:11.910
It's up!

00:01:11.910 --> 00:01:12.920
Up!

00:01:13.800 --> 00:01:16.380
All right, it should be all right now.

00:01:16.900 --> 00:01:21.120
That was one big commotion, but it looks like we can finally feel at ease.

00:01:29.050 --> 00:01:30.440
It's been four years, hasn't it?

00:01:32.030 --> 00:01:34.150
Since the day we met.

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:36.780
You're right.

00:01:36.780 --> 00:01:44.690
The girl who begged to stay here has now proved capable of bringing in money by breeding a colt.

00:01:44.690 --> 00:01:49.140
You should loosen up more and go make some harps or something.

00:01:50.820 --> 00:01:55.840
Speaking of harps, you've become better at making and playing them than I.

00:01:56.420 --> 00:01:57.800
That's not true...

00:01:58.570 --> 00:02:03.060
But of course, I'm still better at inventing songs, don't you think?

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:20.610
Asan.

00:02:22.790 --> 00:02:25.910
It's been a while, Father.

00:02:28.480 --> 00:02:34.380
The Two's Pasts

00:02:48.500 --> 00:02:51.380
Nice to meet you.  My name is Erin.

00:02:54.450 --> 00:02:58.330
Father, please think about it.

00:02:58.720 --> 00:03:04.280
You, who was once the reverend of the teachers, the highest ranking scholar in the capital,

00:03:04.880 --> 00:03:08.250
plan to live out your life at a place like this?

00:03:08.560 --> 00:03:14.180
Mother and I aren't the only people waiting to see you regain that honor.

00:03:14.790 --> 00:03:23.640
Takaran, the elite bureaucrat, was exiled due to treachery against the Queen, so he'll never regain his seat as a scholar.

00:03:23.950 --> 00:03:27.910
Hear me, Father.  Please come back.

00:03:28.700 --> 00:03:32.340
We are waiting to have you back.

00:03:33.850 --> 00:03:35.560
Give me some time to think.

00:03:38.050 --> 00:03:44.080
If concerns for this girl are on your mind, then I'll persuade Mother.

00:03:44.080 --> 00:03:49.370
We can welcome her in our home and, when the time is right, we can marry her off to a decent family.

00:03:50.190 --> 00:03:54.360
If she is adopted by us, the Tousana family, I'm sure there will be somewhere to go.

00:03:56.930 --> 00:03:58.770
Give me some time to think.

00:04:01.490 --> 00:04:03.230
Very well.

00:04:04.020 --> 00:04:09.030
I have a vacation in ten days, so I'll return again then.

00:04:09.900 --> 00:04:12.940
I'll expect an answer then.

00:05:12.540 --> 00:05:13.570
Erin?

00:05:15.610 --> 00:05:17.360
You took too much!

00:05:17.360 --> 00:05:19.190
This is fine!

00:05:20.760 --> 00:05:21.440
Hey!

00:05:21.790 --> 00:05:22.690
Stop it.

00:05:23.050 --> 00:05:24.250
You guys.

00:05:24.250 --> 00:05:26.210
Have you seen Erin?

00:05:26.210 --> 00:05:28.780
The little girl's looking at the colt.

00:05:28.780 --> 00:05:29.910
I see.

00:05:34.370 --> 00:05:36.230
Itadakimasu!

00:05:41.760 --> 00:05:43.440
So this is where you were.

00:05:44.150 --> 00:05:45.830
How's the colt doing?

00:05:46.090 --> 00:05:47.930
It's doing well.

00:05:51.610 --> 00:05:54.000
Please forgive Asan.

00:05:55.710 --> 00:05:59.550
He's only lived within the environment of the capital's top school.

00:06:00.930 --> 00:06:07.590
He's honest, but has a tendency to seek and overly value honor and social status.

00:06:08.120 --> 00:06:11.860
So you were the reverend of the teachers, right?

00:06:13.660 --> 00:06:14.810
Sorry.

00:06:16.380 --> 00:06:18.250
Why are you apologizing?

00:06:18.910 --> 00:06:21.390
For not telling you.

00:06:24.390 --> 00:06:27.400
You should live here with me and-

00:06:29.660 --> 00:06:32.740
No, nothing.

00:06:40.910 --> 00:06:44.430
Erin.  I'll tell you everything about me.

00:06:45.220 --> 00:06:47.880
I want you to listen well.

00:06:49.050 --> 00:06:50.970
Tousana Jone.

00:06:50.970 --> 00:06:53.400
That's my real name.

00:06:54.460 --> 00:07:00.480
I was a teacher at Tamuyuan Academy, a school only the wealthiest can attend, even within the capital.

00:07:01.470 --> 00:07:03.770
I like teaching.

00:07:04.280 --> 00:07:11.040
I didn't just do so in order to follow my parents' footprints, but also because I believed that I am best suited to being a teacher.

00:07:11.370 --> 00:07:14.160
It's a job I enjoy, so I'm into it, too.

00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:17.300
I was eventually acknowledged, and when I was 40,

00:07:17.570 --> 00:07:19.660
I became the reverend of the teachers.

00:07:27.240 --> 00:07:28.330
Niikana.

00:07:30.780 --> 00:07:33.280
Why won't you take the graduation exam?

00:07:33.280 --> 00:07:36.010
This is where your future is decided.

00:07:37.880 --> 00:07:44.790
If I pass the test, I will advance to the next academic level and greater tuition will come with it.

00:07:46.020 --> 00:07:49.920
With my family's status, I can't wish for more.

00:07:53.170 --> 00:07:59.940
Then using my reverend authority, I'll consider waiving the tuition if you get the highest score on the exam.

00:08:01.440 --> 00:08:04.160
Don't worry about a thing and just take the exam.

00:08:05.430 --> 00:08:08.360
Thank you very much, Reverend!

00:08:09.510 --> 00:08:12.630
It's impossible for Niikana.

00:08:13.130 --> 00:08:14.390
Saman.

00:08:14.730 --> 00:08:18.650
I will be the one to ace the exam, being that I <i>am</i> number one.

00:08:19.870 --> 00:08:26.110
Saman.  The methods you have used to this day won't work on the graduation exam.

00:08:27.130 --> 00:08:28.570
What are you implying?

00:08:29.550 --> 00:08:32.640
Saman wasn't especially bright.

00:08:32.640 --> 00:08:40.120
The reason he came in first in all the tests was because of his father.

00:08:40.120 --> 00:08:43.600
Takaran bribed the proctors and knew the problems on the test beforehand.

00:08:45.420 --> 00:08:48.300
Their grade on the graduation exam determines whether the student

00:08:48.300 --> 00:08:53.570
graduating from high school will be able to work in the field they wish to or not.

00:08:53.570 --> 00:08:56.390
Saman, who knew all of the problems in advance,

00:08:56.390 --> 00:09:02.340
was of course planning to follow in his father's footsteps and become an elite bureaucrat.

00:09:03.100 --> 00:09:07.330
But I changed the exam problems at the last minute.

00:09:07.330 --> 00:09:14.520
Since problems he didn't know ahead of time were on the exam, his true ability would surface.

00:09:14.520 --> 00:09:15.490
Begin!

00:09:35.250 --> 00:09:37.590
Niikana's grade was superb.

00:09:38.080 --> 00:09:40.240
He took away first place.

00:09:41.090 --> 00:09:46.600
On the other hand, Saman's grade was nowhere near enough to become an elite bureaucrat.

00:09:57.290 --> 00:10:00.260
Regarding the result of the graduation exam...

00:10:00.260 --> 00:10:03.050
I heard what happened from Saman.

00:10:03.050 --> 00:10:06.960
Apparently, Niikana threatened Saman to not get a good grade.

00:10:07.270 --> 00:10:08.600
That's ridiculous.

00:10:08.600 --> 00:10:13.730
He threatened my boy to not write the answer even if he knew the answer.

00:10:15.660 --> 00:10:18.190
Is that true, Saman?

00:10:21.550 --> 00:10:23.350
Answer me, Saman.

00:10:23.910 --> 00:10:27.130
I'm telling you that my son was threatened!

00:10:27.520 --> 00:10:28.350
Takaran.

00:10:28.910 --> 00:10:34.110
Even Sir Tosariel knows that you were acting behind the scenes.

00:10:34.450 --> 00:10:35.870
What?

00:10:39.630 --> 00:10:43.080
Saman.  What are exams to you?

00:10:43.380 --> 00:10:47.160
Aren't they a place to test your own strength against barriers, to overcome on your own?

00:10:48.240 --> 00:10:51.510
Everyone does their best to overcome these barriers.

00:10:53.260 --> 00:10:57.710
People's futures are established based on these grades.

00:10:58.770 --> 00:11:02.580
But those who do not put in the effort won't even make it to the barriers!

00:11:04.800 --> 00:11:07.870
I'll allow you to have a reexamination three days from today.

00:11:08.530 --> 00:11:12.330
There will be no threats from Niikana there.

00:11:12.330 --> 00:11:16.780
You can prove your ability with that grade.

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:18.490
Jone!

00:11:18.740 --> 00:11:20.400
He doesn't need to take another exam!

00:11:20.400 --> 00:11:23.800
You can just re-grade the exam so he can follow in my footsteps.

00:11:24.190 --> 00:11:29.010
As the reverend of the teachers, I will absolutely not permit any fraudulence in Tamuyuan!

00:11:30.080 --> 00:11:35.770
With those being my last words, Saman and Takaran left.

00:11:39.440 --> 00:11:41.980
That night, Saman tried to commit suicide.

00:11:44.850 --> 00:11:51.430
Takaran accused me, saying Saman tried to commit suicide because I didn't believe him.

00:11:52.080 --> 00:11:59.490
Then he appealed to the other bureaucrats to agree that I was the worst reverend.

00:12:00.250 --> 00:12:06.650
Sir Tosariel, the principal of the school, lost to the pressure coming from them and fired me.

00:12:07.790 --> 00:12:12.450
Even Tamuyuan, the best of the noble high schools,

00:12:12.450 --> 00:12:18.510
in the end, it was just a field of politics where the words of elite bureaucrats like Takaran held power.

00:12:20.300 --> 00:12:29.680
I came this far hoping to forget everything and spend the rest of my life as an ordinary civilian, as just an old honey man.

00:12:30.470 --> 00:12:40.530
But after meeting you, seeing you cry, laugh, and asking me all sorts of questions with eyes filled with curiosity,

00:12:41.520 --> 00:12:46.960
I couldn't hold back the passion in me from re-emerging.

00:12:48.130 --> 00:12:52.640
It was even more so when I saw you trying to learn various things.

00:12:54.920 --> 00:12:57.690
I want to continue to live here with you.

00:12:58.490 --> 00:13:00.810
But honestly, I'm at a loss.

00:13:04.680 --> 00:13:08.390
Would you be against living in the capital with me as my adopted daughter?

00:13:16.910 --> 00:13:19.700
Would you give me some time?

00:13:22.360 --> 00:13:23.950
There's no need to rush.

00:13:24.530 --> 00:13:26.460
Think through it well.

00:14:27.000 --> 00:14:33.810
<i>Erin.  If you really want to become a Touda doctor, then I will teach you properly.</i>

00:14:35.010 --> 00:14:35.890
<i>Okay! </i>

00:14:44.630 --> 00:14:46.960
Are you happy to be here?

00:14:50.370 --> 00:14:51.960
Of course you are.

00:15:16.360 --> 00:15:19.910
Here we go, here we go, here we go!

00:15:21.160 --> 00:15:23.570
Itadakimasu!

00:15:26.360 --> 00:15:28.570
Thank you for your help.

00:15:28.570 --> 00:15:31.310
We'd do anything for you, little girl!

00:15:31.310 --> 00:15:32.590
We would!

00:15:35.370 --> 00:15:37.580
Oji-san, I'm going to the mountain.

00:15:37.580 --> 00:15:39.910
Oh, is it that time already?

00:15:40.570 --> 00:15:43.430
You think the beast-lord will show up today?

00:15:44.130 --> 00:15:45.880
No, no sign yet.

00:15:47.090 --> 00:15:54.000
You go to that cliff every day, yet they don't want to show up, do they?

00:15:56.360 --> 00:15:59.780
You're a girl, yet searching for beast-lords is your hobby.

00:15:59.780 --> 00:16:01.650
What a peculiar child.

00:16:05.960 --> 00:16:15.280
Hey, I just remembered that there's one woman who was absorbed in beast-lords, like you, and she became a teacher.

00:16:15.760 --> 00:16:18.790
She's a teacher, as a woman?

00:16:19.430 --> 00:16:21.780
Yeah.  Her name is Esal.

00:16:21.780 --> 00:16:27.810
She should still be working as a beastinarian for the beast-lords at the Beast-Lord Custody Center at Kazalm.

00:16:28.530 --> 00:16:31.270
Beastinarian for the beast-lords...

00:16:34.010 --> 00:16:37.220
Oji-san!  What's Kazalm like?

00:16:37.860 --> 00:16:43.230
Kazalm is a place where beast-lords are taken care of until they die.

00:16:43.640 --> 00:16:48.730
Um, if I go to Kazalm, can I become a beastinarian?

00:16:50.800 --> 00:16:56.730
Kazalm is a place where beast-lords that have finished their duty go.

00:16:57.170 --> 00:17:00.720
The beastinarians there hardly get any credit.

00:17:00.720 --> 00:17:02.580
It's an unrewarding job.

00:17:03.640 --> 00:17:09.080
Any small change in the beast-lord's condition and the beastinarian is accused.

00:17:10.290 --> 00:17:11.950
Depending on the case...

00:17:16.950 --> 00:17:20.590
They have to pay the cost with their life.

00:17:22.250 --> 00:17:25.020
Why would you know that?

00:17:26.060 --> 00:17:29.710
My mother was a beastinarian as well.

00:17:29.710 --> 00:17:30.570
What?

00:17:32.790 --> 00:17:35.980
My mother was a Touda beastinarian.

00:17:37.070 --> 00:17:42.850
She was formerly of the Mist People, but raised me in Ake Village by herself.

00:17:42.850 --> 00:17:47.570
Even within the village, she was looked up to as a Touda beastinarian.

00:17:48.090 --> 00:17:52.060
One day, the important Kiba kept at the pond died.

00:17:52.060 --> 00:17:57.440
Mother was charged with being responsible and was executed at Lagoe Swamp.

00:17:58.030 --> 00:18:02.640
I tried to save my mother in the swamp,

00:18:03.480 --> 00:18:07.660
but I couldn't accomplish that then.

00:18:09.470 --> 00:18:13.620
I really liked how my mother looked at Touda.

00:18:13.860 --> 00:18:19.820
I've always wanted to become a beastinarian like my mother.

00:18:21.340 --> 00:18:23.970
I always wondered,

00:18:24.800 --> 00:18:29.670
whether taking you to a school in the capital was best for you or not.

00:18:30.470 --> 00:18:37.600
Girls that enter the schools in the capital are all forced to gain the education and learn the mannerisms

00:18:37.600 --> 00:18:40.490
suited for becoming the wife of an aristocrat or an elite worker.

00:18:41.490 --> 00:18:46.400
I always wondered whether sending you to a place like that was really for your benefit or not.

00:18:47.500 --> 00:18:51.070
I'm happy living with you.

00:18:52.170 --> 00:18:54.140
I want to keep this life, forever.

00:18:54.990 --> 00:18:58.260
But if that isn't possible,

00:18:58.720 --> 00:18:59.920
then I...

00:19:02.400 --> 00:19:05.130
I want to live my own path!

00:19:09.100 --> 00:19:15.930
I don't want to live as your adopted daughter at your house in the capital and get married!

00:19:20.270 --> 00:19:21.860
I'll talk to Esal.

00:19:24.130 --> 00:19:27.640
I'm sure Esal will understand your feelings.

00:19:30.120 --> 00:19:33.220
Thank you very much, Oji-san.

00:19:34.200 --> 00:19:35.900
Thank you for doing this for me.

00:19:37.440 --> 00:19:41.810
I spent these days thinking I was your parent.

00:19:42.350 --> 00:19:47.410
It's only natural to do what parents would do for your future.

00:19:49.010 --> 00:19:51.700
Thank you, Oji-san.

00:21:04.350 --> 00:21:05.540
What's this?

00:21:05.860 --> 00:21:09.070
I won't return to the capital with you.

00:21:09.070 --> 00:21:10.170
Father!

00:21:10.600 --> 00:21:11.880
Hold your horses.

00:21:12.720 --> 00:21:16.930
Take that letter to Esal over at Kazalm.

00:21:17.640 --> 00:21:20.510
I plan to hand Erin over to Esal.

00:21:20.510 --> 00:21:25.050
I'll wait for the answer, head to Kazalm, then return home.

00:21:26.880 --> 00:21:28.050
An exam?

00:21:29.310 --> 00:21:30.280
That's right.

00:21:31.840 --> 00:21:36.600
To enter Kazalm, there's an exam called the Trial of the Entrées.

00:21:37.220 --> 00:21:41.460
Before Esal's answer arrives, you need to cram the material.

00:21:42.140 --> 00:21:47.090
The most I can do is to give you all the knowledge I have.

00:21:47.590 --> 00:21:51.800
Will you teach me, Oji-san?

00:21:52.010 --> 00:21:54.870
Of course!  Leave it to me.

00:21:59.700 --> 00:22:05.720
Jone taught her everything he knew, to the best of his ability.

00:22:06.510 --> 00:22:14.350
He thought that it was the last thing he could do for Erin, who would be parting ways with him.

00:24:02.100 --> 00:24:08.620
Since the day I was bought by a Sezan, I lived believing kindness was weakness.

00:24:09.690 --> 00:24:15.710
One day, a girl with green eyes came to Yantok's place with a broken harp.

00:24:16.490 --> 00:24:22.410
The tune, Bird of Dawn, quietly started to play in my heart.

00:24:22.410 --> 00:24:25.040
Kemono no Souja Erin. Ial the Sezan.

00:24:25.040 --> 00:24:30.020
Ial the Sezan
